{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-07/1060549/block/singleImage/3249885/wm/01KWWYCSQCMA948YQ9D5PGS8H9.jpg?updatedAt=1793090559\"/><figcaption>立法會主席李慧琼可獲雙倍月薪，即221,060元</figcaption></figure><p>立法會議員本月起加薪1.6%，月薪達110,530元。 可獲15%任滿酬金 議員的酬金及醫療津貼在每年10月，會根據丙類消費物價指數的變動幅度作出調整。議員本月起加薪，月薪達110,530元。兼任行政會議成員的議員則僅獲三分之二薪金，即月薪73,690元。至於立法會主席李慧琼可獲雙倍月薪，即221,060元。立法會代理主席兼內務委員會主席陳振英月薪165,800元。議員可於完成任期時獲得任滿酬金，金額相等於在立法會任期內所得酬金總額的15%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:31.588576+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:20:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:18:08.855292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:24.488649+00:00","content_hash":"12f2c09fe8d131b7b87dfc7492d3da0db7fd2392fbb2477f6e50efbab7063ca5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:31.588576+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}